  "changelog": "Initial release of wind resource assessment skill.\n\n- Computes per-pixel wind resource parameters from wind-speed time series, including mean wind speed, wind power density (WPD), and Weibull distribution (method of moments/maximum likelihood).\n- Includes power-law wind speed height extrapolation and annual energy yield estimation.\n- Supports local GeoTIFF wind speed rasters and fully offline synthetic data generation for testing.\n- Outputs results as GeoTIFFs (mean wind speed, WPD, Weibull k/c), plus summary and manifest JSONs.\n- All computation runs locally; no external network requests or data upload.",
